[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、まだいらっしゃったのね。\nもしかして、私たちを待っていてくださったの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my, you're still here. Were you perhaps waiting for us?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "先ほどの話がまだ途中だったのでな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our earlier conversation wasn't finished."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちがここで働いている理由……だったかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah yes, why we're working here... wasn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "先ほどのやり取りを見ていたが、\n少々荒っぽいこともしているようだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I saw your earlier exchange. It seems you're not above getting a bit rough with customers."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうにも気にかかる店だ。そちらの動向も含めてな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This place troubles me. Including whatever you two are really up to."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。気にかけてくださるのは嬉しいけれど、\nあまり人の私生活に立ち入るものではなくってよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How sweet that you're concerned, but it's rather rude to pry into people's private lives."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、そうね……そこまで知りたいというなら、\n私たちとひとつ、「勝負」をしてみませんこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though, if you're that curious... how about we make a little wager?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "勝負？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A wager?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この店では、お客様が店員と遊戯で楽しむことが\nできますの。もちろん、お代はいただきますけれど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This establishment offers entertainment games between customers and staff. For a price, of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど。それで我々が勝てば、\nそちらの情報を教えてくれる、と",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. And if we win, you'll tell us what we want to know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。話が早くて助かります。\n私、頭がいい方は好きよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Precisely. I do appreciate quick thinking. I have a weakness for clever men."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……それはどうも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...How flattering."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（いちいちやりづらい……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She's making this difficult...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいだろう。それで、遊戯の種類は何がある？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fine. What games do you offer?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たとえばこういうのはどうかしら。\nこの棒状のお菓子を使った遊戯なのですけれど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, how about this? There's a game involving these stick-shaped sweets..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "両端をお互いに口にくわえて、\n少しずつ食べ進んでいくという……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both players hold opposite ends in their mouths, then slowly eat toward the center..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "却下だ。ふざけるのはよせ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rejected. Quit fooling around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "からかいだって分かるとはさすが。\nでは、カード遊びなどは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, you saw right through my teasing. Then how about a card game?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでいい。さっさと始めるぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That'll work. Let's get started."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふふ。承知いたしました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Very well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ふむ……今のところは優勢。\n\u3000ブラッド殿はなかなか腕に覚えがあるようだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Hmm... we're doing well so far. Brad seems quite skilled at this.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（しかし、相手はこの二人……油断はできませんね）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But our opponents are these two... we can't let our guard down.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……お強いのね。\nこのままでは負けてしまいそうだわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You're quite good. At this rate, we might actually lose."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだな。このまま勝たせてもらおうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. I'll be taking that victory."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふふ、そうはいきません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm afraid not."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今ガ\u3000仕掛ケドコロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now's The Time To Strike."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェーロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hielo"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュちゃん、ここで勝負よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go for it, Antje!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アオナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Azure"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こら、名前呼んじゃダメ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't use my name..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ann"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "チップ全賭けだと！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All in?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "別に降りても構いませんのよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're welcome to fold, of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうします？\u3000念のため注視していましたが、\n何かイカサマをしているというわけでもなさそうです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What should we do? I've been watching carefully, and they don't appear to be cheating."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……確率的にはこちらが絶対的に有利だ。\nここで退くわけにはいかない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Statistically, the odds are overwhelmingly in our favor. We can't back down now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "受けて立とう。さあ、カードを引け！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll take that bet. Go ahead, draw your card!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……いくわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Here goes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ann"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふっ――！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haaah—!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ann"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やった！\u3000大当たりだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Jackpot!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アオナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Azure"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "狙イ通リ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just As Planned...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェーロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hielo"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにぃっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったよ、クリセ……じゃなかった。リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We did it, Crise— I mean, Rise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ann"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よくやったわ、アン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well done, Ann."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。私たちの勝ちのようですわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It appears victory is ours."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ！\u3000もう１回だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Damn it! One more round!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、もちろん。受けて立ちましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Certainly. We accept your challenge."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rise"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]